OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian in 70s dies after being
OL,4,Ahit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 70s has died after being
OL,7,Fhit by a car.
OL,9,FNorthumbria Police said it received
OL,10,Freports of the collision on Wealcroft
OL,11,Fnear the Staneway junction in Gateshead
OL,12,Fat about 16:45 BST on Monday.
OL,14,FThe man was struck by a blue Volvo S40
OL,15,Fcar and died at the scene.
OL,17,FAn 18-year-old was arrested on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of causing death by careless
OL,19,Fdriving and has since been released on
OL,20,Fbail, the force said. Sgt Greg Huntley
OL,21,Furged witnesses to contact the police.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
